<metadata><name>Galičica trail T-8</name><desc>T-8 is one of Galičica National Park's harder and longer hiking trails, with more climbing. It runs 10.1 km from near Stenje (858 m) to above Leskoec (1,513 m), climbing about 706 m and descending 53 m in the direction drawn, between 857 m and 1,530 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/t-8/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
